        "ja": "[2026.03.29]\n編者：これ、めっちゃシュールで面白いね。(笑)\n投稿者：ほんとに笑えるよね。たまたま通りかかったら、木に傘が引っかかってて。どうやって掛けたのか想像つかない。そんなに飲んだのかな。\n編者：夜中に飲んで帰る途中で、誰かの「ノリでやってみよう」っていうチャレンジっぽい感じするね。\n投稿者：もしかして誰かの傘を拾って、そのまま…………………。\n編者：やばい、それはちょっと悪いね。(笑)\n[2026.04.24]\n投稿者：まだあそこにあるよ!\n編者：葉っぱも出てきたのに、まだある!\n投稿者：春夏秋冬で記録できそうだね。こんな細い枝に掛かってたんだ。めっちゃ逞しい。奇跡の傘だね!!",
        "en": "[2026.03.29]\nEditor: Haha, this is so absurd-it's really interesting.\nSender: It's actually hilarious. I just happened to pass by and saw an umbrella hanging on a tree. It's hard to imagine how it even got up there. Were they that drunk?\nEditor: Feels like one of those \"let's try this\" ideas someone had on the way home after drinking at night.\nSender: Maybe they picked up someone else's umbrella and then...\nEditor: Haha, that's kind of evil.\n[2026.04.24]\nSender: It's still there!\nEditor: Even though the leaves have started to grow in, it's still hanging on!\nSender: Looks like we'll be able to document it through all four seasons. I can't believe it was hanging on such a tiny branch. It's so resilient. It really is a miracle umbrella!"
